  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "收到你的信，仿佛在深埋的土壤中挖掘到稀世珍宝，珍贵而难得。",
      "output_sha256": "2e313038d4d5e416a57a129660974456bfbee53af5d7e24fad76fe12ab3eff4c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.404038,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "85c16389b34f11cdaa0635db6fb920477043cfc3d18e4a067bb38b1d8e5e30db"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2e313038d4d5e416a57a129660974456bfbee53af5d7e24fad76fe12ab3eff4c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "阅读你的信，似乎是在端详古老的残碑，表面模糊，却蕴藏着深远的意义。",
      "output_sha256": "d8bc17459678270e5c3d979e4d7aed32040511a3c4ec19abf0a066186b5d56c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.485293,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "812121fa15253c7d28ed61851f388d8717f5c94619c1f7af9342ca13ce3437e1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8bc17459678270e5c3d979e4d7aed32040511a3c4ec19abf0a066186b5d56c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又像是在尼罗河旁边幕夜，在月亮正照着金字塔的时候，梦见一个穿黄金袍服的帝王，对着我作谜语，我知道他的意思，他说：“我无非是一个体面的木乃伊；”",
      "output_sha256": "3adf18ab6949f3a159fc5cdd74d5cf40286c43c8c80972f1a6540edfce2bd3ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "3adf18ab6949f3a159fc5cdd74d5cf40286c43c8c80972f1a6540edfce2bd3ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又像是我在这重山脚下半夜梦醒时，听见松林里夜鹰的Soprano可怜的遭人厌毁的鸟，他虽则没有子规那样天赋的妙舌，但我却懂得他的怨愤，他的理想，他的急调是他的嘲讽与咒诅；我知道他怎样的鄙蔑一切，鄙蔑光明，鄙蔑烦嚣的燕雀，也鄙弃自喜的画眉；",
      "output_sha256": "9db8154c5bdc2969cdb68c10db2384886ec14dce8c9d2385ec3a1bcab1866d6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "9db8154c5bdc2969cdb68c10db2384886ec14dce8c9d2385ec3a1bcab1866d6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又像是我在普陀山发现的一个奇景；外面看是一大块岩石，但里面却早被海水蚀空，只剩罗汉头似的一个脑壳，每次海涛向这岛身搂抱时，发出极奥妙的音响，像是情话，像是咒诅，像是祈祷，在雕空的石笋、钟乳间呜咽，像大和琴的谐音在皋雪格的古寺的花椽、石楹间回荡──但除非你有耐心与勇气，攀下几重的石岩，俯身下去凝神的察看与倾听，你也许永远不会想像，不必说发现这样的秘密；",
      "output_sha256": "562acb8acfb7f0844a33dc33a5f5f3a5045093b8d51f5b3773057b6db3f75d3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "562acb8acfb7f0844a33dc33a5f5f3a5045093b8d51f5b3773057b6db3f75d3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又像是……但是我知道，朋友，你已经听够了我的比喻，也许你愿意听我自然的嗓音与不做作的语调，不愿意收受用幻想的亮箔包裹着的话，虽则，我不能不补一句，你自己就是最喜欢从一个弯曲的白银喇叭里，吹弄你的古怪的调子。",
      "output_sha256": "b94269b00ef219c247e8a1defda0aebda7049f68b40e3e3895fb395994368ee5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "b94269b00ef219c247e8a1defda0aebda7049f68b40e3e3895fb395994368ee5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你说：“风大土大，生活干燥。”",
      "output_sha256": "081b337a18099496e99afbd84261f78d722d697126321ace77e19d4aba62fb0e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "081b337a18099496e99afbd84261f78d722d697126321ace77e19d4aba62fb0e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这话仿佛是一阵奇怪的凉风，使我感觉一个恐怖的战栗；像一团飘零的秋叶，使我的灵魂里掉下一滴悲悯的清泪。",
      "output_sha256": "8cd4a40dfb341abfd542f06804377e8a217a211de9545c24f2f41c0622251ae1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "8cd4a40dfb341abfd542f06804377e8a217a211de9545c24f2f41c0622251ae1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的记忆里，我似乎自信，并不是没有葡萄酒的颜色与香味，并不是没有妩媚的微笑的痕迹，我想我总可以抵抗你那句灰色的语调的影响──",
      "output_sha256": "d25cac4ab21fc472a4ba4e4286558f16d9edd4de7bd69b1a7bad7b09d8da086d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "d25cac4ab21fc472a4ba4e4286558f16d9edd4de7bd69b1a7bad7b09d8da086d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，昨天下午我在田里散步的时候，我不是分明看见两块凶恶的黑云消灭在太阳猛烈的光焰里，五只小山羊，兔子一样的白净，听着她们妈的吩咐在路旁寻草吃，三个捉草的小孩在一个稻屯前抛掷镰刀；自然的活泼给我不少的鼓舞，我对著白云里矗着的宝塔喊说我知道生命是有意趣的。",
      "output_sha256": "c9cc6fa0d358834bb96aa30e2345d33747adca919abf1f0a736f1e139d3b8347",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "c9cc6fa0d358834bb96aa30e2345d33747adca919abf1f0a736f1e139d3b8347",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而今天，太阳并未升起。",
      "output_sha256": "a7952384b05c655c2214ccfd975216ef7911013bcc039ecfb42cfaaa05e538e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.454231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "063b4b3e59bc1f94574361d56f3c516fdaf981873905969e2028f3ac4fbfb917"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a7952384b05c655c2214ccfd975216ef7911013bcc039ecfb42cfaaa05e538e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "云层在空中紧紧相依，你的话语又为天空增添了几层阴霾，我开始怀疑自己昨日的宣言。",
      "output_sha256": "23e2c774dfc33858920db288b2a24170faabdf96324e4f6b6d372eb1a21680e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.474538,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fd0555e00eb12185d9c5f73672c76b6704b2e7a5e4a7a4b6717bfc39e57e627f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "23e2c774dfc33858920db288b2a24170faabdf96324e4f6b6d372eb1a21680e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也觉得奇怪，朋友，何以你那句话在我的心里，竟像白垩涂在玻璃上，这半透明的沉闷是一种很巧妙的刑罚；我差不多要喊痛了。",
      "output_sha256": "98a326a40c41842f2f86a30b23850c1f0b66e6099c09df30b5f8901997c90d2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "98a326a40c41842f2f86a30b23850c1f0b66e6099c09df30b5f8901997c90d2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我向我的窗外望，暗沉沉的一片，也没有月亮，也没有星光，日光更不必想，他早已离别了，那边黑蔚蔚的是林子，树上，我知道，是夜鸮的寓处，树下累累的在初夜的微芒中排列着，我也知道。",
      "output_sha256": "a13532c6204e259fa855942b7777920c6c71d8e8c6d9de48aa833b43f3ece22b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "a13532c6204e259fa855942b7777920c6c71d8e8c6d9de48aa833b43f3ece22b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是坟墓，僵的白骨埋在硬的泥里，磷火也不见一星，这样的静，这样的惨，黑夜的胜利是完全的了。",
      "output_sha256": "547c2674e4179e6f8891b97bea4fe3a2fd7cad05b54b2293155b767de953e613",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "547c2674e4179e6f8891b97bea4fe3a2fd7cad05b54b2293155b767de953e613",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我闭上眼睛，向我的内心询问，啊，我竟找不到一个与干燥无关的生活意象，干燥如影随形，永远跟随生活的脚步，像是葱头的葱管，始终附着在生活的顶端，这真是一件奇事。",
      "output_sha256": "cd81f8f3020102d568a2e66445e2f11fb8fefe89631f3d392134243bb2abbc40",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.644098,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "01a8abf444c1c4d25744af9642371a6a2b3f85af0092960b2e9cfdd1c285504c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cd81f8f3020102d568a2e66445e2f11fb8fefe89631f3d392134243bb2abbc40",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "朋友，我抱歉，我不能答覆你的话，虽则我很想，我不是爽恺的西风，吹不散天上的云罗，我手里只有一把粗拙的泥锹，如其有美丽的理想或是希望要埋葬，我的工作倒是现成的──我也有过我的经验。",
      "output_sha256": "e80cf0962cb66f5448377f75fa288264efb9dc352b62e4652bc0c7d6906758f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "e80cf0962cb66f5448377f75fa288264efb9dc352b62e4652bc0c7d6906758f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "朋友，我也担忧，最终我只能接受你的影响，因为你的那句话已经狠辣地刺入我的心中，像一只有毒的蝎子，重重地压在我的心上，我只能忍耐，我只能忍耐……",
      "output_sha256": "6fe3c0caf0017d4de601588011cfd0271775a2d5d353b36192459cc4e307fd87",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.615247,
